  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:16px\">\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><img src=\"https://wolforcept.github.io/images/simpleshops_stockupdate.png\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1070\"></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><img src=\"https://wolforcept.github.io/images/simpleshops2.png\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1070\"></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>簡單商店模組</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">這個模組加入了玩家商店和創造模式商店，</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">而且設定和使用都非常簡單！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">只需合成商店並將其放置在地面上。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">用物品右鍵點擊來<strong>設定價格</strong>，</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">然後<strong>再次右鍵點擊</strong>來放入一些<strong>要販售的物品</strong>。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">你可以將它留在任何地方，因為其他玩家無法破壞它！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">之後你可以用<strong>左鍵點擊</strong>來<strong>收取利潤</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">如果你想<strong>拆除商店</strong>，可以在<strong>潛行時左鍵點擊</strong>來完成。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>更新內容：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">現在你可以用空手右鍵點擊來補充更多庫存！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">你還可以為你的商店添加庫存顯示器！並且可以自訂顏色！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://wolforcept.github.io/images/simpleshops_recipe.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">請觀看下方的教學影片！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/yb0MZE6b5Fk?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<br><hr><br>  \n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://wolforcept.github.io/images/line.png\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/prpWgGu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wolforcept.github.io/images/discord650x366.png\" width=\"650\" height=\"366\"></a><br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\">歡迎加入 Discord 並分享你的想法與回饋！</span><br><br></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fwolforce\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"211\"></a><br>由 BISECT HOSTING 贊助<br>致力於讓你的 Minecraft 伺服器托管體驗變得盡可能簡單且經濟實惠。<br>使用代碼 \"<strong>wolforce</strong>\" 即可在首次訂閱任何遊戲伺服器時享有 25% 折扣。<br><br></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<br><hr><br>    \n<table style=\"text-align:center;width:100%;display:inline\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a style=\"color:#17a12e;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mctcg\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <strong>MCTCG</strong> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a style=\"color:#a40;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mega-builds\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <strong>Mega 建築</strong> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a style=\"color:#292929;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-shops\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <strong>簡單商店</strong> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a style=\"color:#575454;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/player-tabs\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <strong>玩家分頁</strong> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a style=\"color:#f60;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/wolforce\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <strong>支持我！</strong> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mctcg\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://wolforcept.github.io/images/mctcg256.gif\" width=\"128\"> </a></td>\n<td>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td